","ruby","vagrant","virtualization"],"visibility":"public","forks":4446,"open_issues":734,"watchers":27145,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/pulls/8661","html_url":"https://github.com/hashicorp/vagrant/pull/8661","diff_url":"https://github.com/hashicorp/vagrant/pull/8661.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/hashicorp/vagrant/pull/8661.patch","merged_at":"2017-06-12T16:39:21Z"},"body":"Prior to this commit, the ssh communicator would use the default cipher\r\nlist in Net::SSH to negociate which ciphers it should use between hosts.\r\nDue to a bug in Net::SSH and the position of the `none` cipher in its\r\ndefault cipher list, if a host supported the none cipher, but also\r\nonly supported other ciphers that came after none in the default list,\r\nit would accept none and attempt to use that cipher instead of the other\r\nsupported ciphers. This commit fixes that behavior by copying the\r\ndefault cipher list from Net::SSH and placing none last in the list so\r\nthat other ciphers can be used in the negotiation before attempting to\r\nuse the unsecure none cipher.\r\n\r\nFixes #6640","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/8661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/8661/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":1117504130,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDExMTc1MDQxMzA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hashicorp/vagrant/issues/events/1117504130","actor":{"login":"briancain","id":810277,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxMDI3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/810277?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/briancain","html_url":"https://github.com/briancain","fol